    "audioStrategy": "Live additive synthesis of one piano-like voice. No recorded samples and no audio files. Each note is five slightly inharmonic sine partials through a velocity-dependent low-pass, plus a short deterministic noise transient synthesized into an AudioBuffer at note-on. If primary setup throws after the AudioContext exists, a single sine oscillator plays and the status is fallback, not ready. If the context cannot be created, the status is error and notes are silent.",
